# =====================================================================
#  travel.map - phishing phrases for travel agencies and tour operators
#  Part of: phishing-detector by Develust Technology
#
#  Format : one regex per line, /pattern/flags (i = case-insensitive,
#           u = UTF-8). No trailing spaces.
#  Note   : PHISH_TEXT scores 0 alone; it only adds points together
#           with a phishing link (PHISH_URL / PHISHING).
#
#  Themes : airline ticket cancellation / refund / compensation claims,
#           visa application problems and fake e-visa fees,
#           supplier bank-detail changes (BEC), GDS account alerts
#           (Amadeus, Sabre, Galileo, Travelport), IATA / BSP payment
#           and accreditation, chargebacks and disputes, fake itinerary
#           and PNR changes
#
#  Avoided: group booking requests, rooming lists and schedule-change
#           notices, because agencies receive real ones every day.
# =====================================================================

# ===== English =====
# Tickets, refunds, compensation
/your\s+(e-?)?ticket\s+(has\s+been|was)\s+(cancelled|canceled|voided|suspended)/i
/claim\s+your\s+(flight\s+|ticket\s+)?refund\s+(now|within|before|today)/i
/(compensation|refund)\s+for\s+your\s+(delayed|cancelled|canceled)\s+flight/i
/your\s+refund\s+(is\s+)?(pending|on\s+hold|awaiting\s+confirmation)/i
/booking\s+reference\s+[A-Z0-9]{6}\s+(has\s+been\s+|was\s+)?(cancelled|canceled|changed|suspended)/i
/view\s+your\s+(updated\s+|revised\s+)?(itinerary|e-?ticket)\s+(here|online|below)/i
# Visa
/your\s+(e-?)?visa\s+application\s+(has\s+been\s+|was\s+)?(rejected|refused|on\s+hold|suspended|incomplete)/i
/(e-?visa|visa)\s+(fee|payment)\s+(is\s+)?(pending|overdue|required|unpaid)/i
/additional\s+documents?\s+(are\s+|is\s+)?required\s+for\s+your\s+visa/i
# Supplier bank details (BEC)
/(we\s+have\s+)?(changed|updated)\s+(our\s+)?bank(ing)?\s+(details|account|information)/i
/(new|updated)\s+bank\s+(account\s+)?details\s+for\s+(all\s+)?(future\s+)?payments/i
/do\s+not\s+(pay|send\s+payment)\s+to\s+(the\s+)?(old|previous)\s+(account|bank)/i
# GDS / IATA / BSP
/(amadeus|sabre|galileo|travelport|worldspan)\s+(account|password|access|login)\s+(will\s+)?(expire|expires|expired|suspended|locked|verification)/i
/(bsp|iata)\s+(payment|settlement|remittance)\s+(failed|overdue|declined|on\s+hold)/i
/(iata|agency)\s+accreditation\s+(suspended|under\s+review|will\s+be\s+revoked|expired)/i
/(expedia\s+taap|booking\.com\s+affiliate|agoda\s+partner)\s+(account\s+)?(suspended|verification|locked)/i
# Disputes
/chargeback\s+(request|dispute|notice)\s+for\s+(booking|reservation|order)/i
/(customer|passenger|traveler|traveller)\s+(has\s+)?(filed|opened|raised)\s+a\s+dispute/i

